cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Single quadratic equations do not compress integer dimension: supplementary Lean 4 development"
abstract: >-
  Supplementary Lean 4 development for the paper "Single quadratic equations do not compress integer
  dimension". It contains a composed formal statement of the structural dichotomy (Theorem 2) and
  formal proofs of Corollaries 3 and 4 (polynomial graphs; failure of closure under composition and
  conjunction), built against the archived development doi:10.5281/zenodo.23053094 (pinned by commit),
  with an audit gate on the axiom reports and on name-based dependency checks. The paper is included.
